      "portrait": "Chinese ink wash painting portrait of a 34-year-old Chinese man, Ming-dynasty China, the senior disciple of a sword sect, broad shoulders and lean waist, strong jaw, sharp sword-like brows, the first faint lines on the forehead, hair in a high topknot bound with a dark blue ribbon, dark blue cotton martial robe with a cloth wrist guard on the right arm, a sword with an empty tassel ring on his back, restrained troubled expression, wet ink gradation on xuan paper, muted indigo and ochre accents, half-length shot",
